{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "A thumping performance from the Windies here. They now have a chance to seal the series in the 2nd T20I. Bangladesh on the other hand, will look to bounce back and level the series in the 2nd T20I. That match will start at 1700 local time (1100 GMT) on 20th December at the Sher-e-Bangla National Cricket Stadium, Dhaka. Join us for that one. Till then, have a good time.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:28:31+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Windies skipper, Carlos Brathwaite, says it is a very good win but it is just the first game and there are still 2 more games to go. States the batting and bowling clicked today and everything they did today, went their way. Ends by saying they can't rest on their laurels and they have to once again bring their best game in the second T20I.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:22:49+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Man of the Match, Sheldon Cottrell, says the bowlers need to be smart on such wickets and they executed their plans well today. Ends by saying he is a soldier and hence, he celebrates the way he does.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:21:06+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Bangladesh skipper, Shakib Al Hasan, says everything went wrong today. Further adds they did not bat well and did not bowl well also. Mentions they did not perform well as a team and hence, lost the match. Ends by saying nothing worked out today other than the toss and they were comprehensively beaten.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:20:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Windies have completely dominated the first T20I. Their  bowlers set it up for the batsmen by restricting Bangladesh to 129. Sheldon Cottrell was the star as he finished with a 4-fer. In reply, Evin Lewis and Shai Hope came out all guns blazing, especially Shai Hope. He scored the fastest T20I fifty by a Windies player. His innings completely took the game away from the home side. Windies wrapped up this chase in just 10.5 overs with 8 wickets in hand to take the lead in this 3-match T20I series.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:17:17+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "LEG BYE! It was bowled quicker on his pads, Paul tries to flick and it hits him on the pads and the ball goes towards the fine leg region. The batsmen managed to take a single in the process. AND WINDIES WIN BY 8 WICKETS.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:03:55+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,324,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "FOUR! Tosses it up on middle, Keemo dances down the track and whips it towards deep mid-wicket and the ball races away to the fence. Scores all level. Just 1 run required for Windies to win the game.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:03:26+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "7,288,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "SIX! Two in two for Paul. It was dragged short and Keemo rocks back and pulls it over deep-mid wicket for a huge six. Spinners have been taken apart from the Windies batsmen today.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:02:40+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "6,264,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "SIX! Keemo looks in a hurry to finish the game off. Slower through the air on middle, the batsman charges down the track and hits it handsomely over long on for a maximum.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:02:00+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "Flighted delivery on middle, Keemo pushes it to the point region.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:01:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,160,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "The batsman has played it to the point region. One run added to the total.", "Summary": {"Score": "113/2", "Over": "10", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "65286", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "12", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "1"}, {"Batsman": "63726", "Runs": "23", "Balls": "17", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3956", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:01:10+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "7,281,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "SIX! WHACKED! Tosses it up on middle, Paul gets to the pitch of the ball and goes uppishly over long on for a huge six.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:00:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "On middle, Paul late cuts it but straight to the short third man fielder.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T09:00:14+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "A tad quicker on middle, Paul defends it with a straight bat.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:59:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,171,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Fuller delivery on middle, Pooran taps it towards point for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:59:26+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "4,162,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "Quicker on off, Paul cuts it towards backward point for a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:58:44+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,194,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "Flatter around off, the batsman goes back and punches it through covers. A run taken.", "Summary": {"Score": "104/2", "Over": "9", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "65286", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "4", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63726", "Runs": "22", "Balls": "16", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3782", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "16", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:57:11+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "62", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,258,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Dances down the track and strokes it to long off for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:56:52+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "61", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Nicely bowled! It is the flatter one outside off, it goes on with the arm. Pooran plays inside the line and gets beaten.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:56:19+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "60", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,279,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "Uses his feet and eases it down to long on for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:56:01+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "59", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,196,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Flatter and outside off, it is cut through point for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:55:41+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "58", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,348,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "Loopy ball on middle, Paul tries to go over covers but gets it off the inner half through mid-wicket for a run. 100 up for the Windies. Another 30 needed.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:55:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "57", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "The batsman has defended it by getting right behind the line of the delivery.", "Summary": {"Score": "99/2", "Over": "8", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63726", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "20", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "65286", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3956", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:54:17+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.5", "Id": "56", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,9,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "65286", "Commentary": "Drifts on his pads, Paul flicks it to the leg side for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:53:52+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Keemo Paul is the new man in.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:53:29+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.4", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "OUT! Bangladesh finally get their man. It was bowled outside off, Hope slashes it over covers but straight to Mustafizur at deep cover, who takes a good catch. A wicket too late for the home side because Hope has taken the game completely away from them. Brilliant innings comes to and end for the opener.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "63797", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:52:18+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.3", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,189,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Tosses is up on off, the batsman pushes it to the cover region for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:51:19+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.2", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Full on off, Pooran reverse sweeps it but straight to the backward point fielder.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:50:59+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.1", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "2,74,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3956", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Starts off with a fuller delivery on middle and leg. Pooran paddles it fine for a couple of runs.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:50:27+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Mahmudullah is brought into the attack.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:49:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.6", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,188,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Pooran rocks on to his back foot and cuts it away to the cover region for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "95/1", "Over": "7", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63726", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "17", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63797", "Runs": "55", "Balls": "22", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "6"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3782", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:48:38+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,342,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Flicked to the mid-wicket region for a single. No six from Hope in this over.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:47:48+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Tossed up by Shakib and Hope drives it straight to the fielder at cover.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:47:29+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "5,184,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Shorter on length by the skipper, Hope punches it off the back foot through the point region for a couple.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:47:12+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Hope tries to heave it over the square leg region but misses the ball. The ball goes between the legs of the batsman.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:46:39+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Flatter on midle and off,  Hope punches it away to the fielder at mid on.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:46:23+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The captain is back into the attack.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:45:55+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,328,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Bowls it short again, this time Shai pulls it towards square leg for a single. 18 from the over of Mehidy.", "Summary": {"Score": "91/1", "Over": "6", "Runs": "18", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63797", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "52", "Balls": "17", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "6"}, {"Batsman": "63726", "Runs": "16", "Balls": "8", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "63875", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "37", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:44:54+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,352,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "SIX! Loose delivery from Hasan here. It was dragged short, Hope hangs back and pulls it over deep mid-wicket for a maximum. Brings up his first fifty as well with that shot. It has been some innings from the southpaw. He was brilliant in the ODI's and he carries it on here.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:44:13+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Fuller this time on off, Hope drives it straight to the mid off fielder.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:43:49+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,194,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "FOUR! What a shot from Hope. Nicely tossed up delivery on middle, Shai lofts it uppishly over extra cover and the ball races away to the fence. Hope looking to finish the game early.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:43:27+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "7,275,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "SIX! HAMMERED! Hasan bowls a full toss on middle, Hope lofts it over mid on for a huge six.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:42:40+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,248,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Fuller delivery on middle, Pooran pushes it towards mid off for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:42:00+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Mehidy Hasan comes to the attack.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:41:50+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "3,129,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63881", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "FOUR! The over started with a boundary and now ends with one! How clever and good was this from Hope. Nothing wrong with the delivery. It is a yorker outside off, Hope at the very end, opens the face of the bat and jams it down to the third man fence.", "Summary": {"Score": "73/1", "Over": "5", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63797", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "35", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "4"}, {"Batsman": "63726", "Runs": "15", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "3", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "63881", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:40:40+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,185,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63881", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Again clever batting by Pooran! Knows there is no need of taking any risk. He taps it towards covers for a quick run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:40:01+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,284,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63881", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "In the air... but over the fielder! Fuller on off, Hope swings but does not get it off the middle. It goes over mid off. The fielder runs behind it but fails to get to it. Single taken.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:39:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,346,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63881", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Fuller in length on middle, Pooran works it around the corner for a run. Good batting, two boundaries and now a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:38:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,221,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63881", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "FOUR! Through the off side this time! The last one was brute power, this one was timing. Full and around off, Pooran leans into it and strokes it through extra cover for back-to-back boundaries.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:38:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,274,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63881", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "FOUR! The run flow continues! Pooran clears his front leg and tonks it over the mid on fielder for a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:37:29+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "3,100,1", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64151", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Goes for a yorker this time and the batsman nicely digs it out towards off side. The batsmen rotate strike. Eventful over comes to an end.", "Summary": {"Score": "58/1", "Over": "4", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63726", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "5", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63797", "Runs": "30", "Balls": "10", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "4"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "64151", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "13", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:35:53+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "7,311,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64151", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "FOUR! Pooran is off the mark here. Saifuddin bowls it short on off, Pooran pulls it towards mid-wicket for a boundary. Good way to the start the innings for the left-hander.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:35:10+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64151", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "Back of a length on middle, Pooran defends it off the back foot and onto the ground.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:34:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64151", "Batsman": "63726", "Commentary": "WIDE! Saifuddin goes for the yorker but misses his line and length and goes wide down leg. Umpire signals a wide.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:34:03+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,352,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64151", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Fuller delivery on middle and leg, Hope flicks it to the leg side for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:33:18+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Nicholas Pooran is the new man in.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:32:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64151", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "OUT! Saifuddin provides the breakthrough. But one would feel, this opening stand has done the job. Lewis tries to continue the attack approach as he goes for the pull. The bounce though gets big on him and he only manages a top edge towards long on. Ariful there runs in and takes it. A much-needed wicket for Bangladesh. Can they fight back?", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "59314", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:32:21+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,343,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64151", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "SIX! WHACKED! Slower delivery from Saifuddin on off, Lewis reads the length early and whacks it over deep-mid wicket for a huge six. Also brings up the fifty partnership between these two. It has been a brisk start from these two.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:30:51+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Mohammad Saifuddin is on now.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:30:10+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "6,258,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63066", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "FOUR! SHOT! Fuller delivery on off, Hope drives it straight past the bowler and through mid off for a boundary. 15 of the over.", "Summary": {"Score": "45/0", "Over": "3", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63797", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "29", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "4"}, {"Batsman": "59314", "Runs": "12", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "63066", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "15", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:29:17+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63066", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Back of a length on middle, Shai punches it off the back foot to the cover fielder.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:28:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "5,188,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63066", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "SIX! Hope in carnage mode. Length delivery on off, Hope slaps it uppishly over extra cover for a huge six. Brilliant shot from the opener.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:28:01+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,351,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63066", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "Short delivery this time on middle, Lewis pulls it towards fine leg for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:27:09+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "1,18,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63066", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "Again fuller on leg, Evin works it to the square leg region for a couple.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:26:36+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "1,10,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63066", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "Starts off with a fuller delivery on leg, Lewis flicks it towards deep square leg for a couple of runs.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:26:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "7,294,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "SIX! Going, going, gone! Third in the over and probably the best of the lot. Hope quickly gets down on one knee and with the turn, slogs it over the long on fence. 23 runs from the over and the run rate is already below 6 now.", "Summary": {"Score": "30/0", "Over": "2", "Runs": "23", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "63797", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "19", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "3"}, {"Batsman": "59314", "Runs": "7", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "63875", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "19", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:24:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.5", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "8,351,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "SIX! Hope is in a hurry here! A half-tracker by Mehidy. Hope has enough time to rock back and then pull it over the square leg fence. Windies are off to a flier here. Ideal start for them.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:23:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.4", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "FOUR LEG BYES! Tries to repeat what he did on the last ball. He misses though. The ball hits his pads, away from the keeper and down to the fine leg fence. 10 from the last 2 balls. Hope on the charge.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:23:18+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.3", "Id": "11", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "6", "ZAD": "1,8,6", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "SIX! Brilliant hit! This was on the pads, Hope goes down on one knee quickly and then slog sweeps it over the square leg fence.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:22:38+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "10", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,349,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "Flatter and on middle, Lewis works it through mid-wicket for a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:21:49+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "9", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "63875", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "Starts off with a short and slow ball outside off, it sticks in the surface. Lewis first thinks of cutting it but due to the pace, guides it to point.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:21:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "8", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Mehidy Hasan to bowl from the other end.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:21:00+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.6", "Id": "7", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,34,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "Wayyy short down leg. Lewis paddles it to the fine leg region for a run. Lewis would be disappointed he did not take full toll of it. 7 of the first over.", "Summary": {"Score": "7/0", "Over": "1", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "59314", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "6", "Balls": "4", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "63797", "Runs": "1", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3782", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "7", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:20:02+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.5", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "A touch short on middle, Evin punches it straight to the point fielder.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:19:45+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.4", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "5,221,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "FOUR! SHOT! Hasan drags it short on off, Lewis hangs back and punches it off the back foot through covers for a boundary. First boundary for the Windies.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:19:27+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.3", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,334,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Tossed up delivery on off, Hope slogs it towards mid-wicket for a run. Hope is off the mark.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:19:03+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "63797", "Commentary": "Slower through the air on middle, Hope defends it off the back foot and onto the ground.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:18:45+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,14,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3782", "Batsman": "59314", "Commentary": "Starts off with a fuller delivery on middle and leg, Lewis tucks it to square leg for a run. He is off the mark with that.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:18:23+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "We are back underway for the start of the Windies innings. Shai Hope and Evin Lewis are out in the middle. Shakib will open for Bangladesh.", "Timestamp": "2018-12-17T08:17:29+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 79, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:15:16 AM"}}}